  "variants": {
    "lanekit_f38_17_solene": {"enabled": true, "_why_on": "LANE-KIT 7 Nov 2026, qj F38-17-f8ab7f3fcf77-11072319: F38#17 CPU mapped 5.81 -> 7.32 (+1.51; raw 5.5 5.6 5.2 -> 6.6 6.6 6.3, all three judges: Solene and Hald now distinct and matching their portraits; defect PARTIAL -> FIXED). Judged gain ships ON.", "_why": "F38#17 (LANE-KIT, 7 Nov 2026; CPU 6.70, GPU 5.84): judges 'Warder Solene and Keeper Hald share one pink-uniform grunt model, and both portraits show a dark masked figure that does not match it'. Installed cast only (no Meshy): the installed officer_b rig and mesh, copied byte-for-byte with its installed graded vis1 atlas embedded (ralph/reports/LANES/ITEM-F38-17/embed_atlas_glb.py), and its installed matching plate officer_b.png. Rank palette, badges, height and clips stay the rank's. Team Tether's own colours. OFF until judged.", "expected_base_profile": "grunt", "expected_model": "res://assets/characters/grunt/grunt_lod0.glb", "body_model_override": "res://assets/characters/npc_identity/lanekit_f38_17_solene/solene_lod0.glb", "body_model_floor_1113": {"_why": "F38#17 (LANE-THINGS, 13 Nov 2026, OFF until judged). GPU 3/3 across three batches: Warder Solene's face is blown out white in the stronghold courtyard. CPU: the plain grunt in her place washes out too, so it is the courtyard light on pale texels; the conversation key light and her self-emission each change little. The Captain Marrow recipe (below6_marrow_self_lit_off, +1.40 on the GPU), for these two bodies only: a second copy of the variant's model whose embedded atlas has texels above 0.38 luma pulled half-way down (hue kept). Pair with character_body_flags.json things_self_lit_off_1112. Provenance: provenance_floor1.json beside the model.", "scope": "client_presentation", "enabled": false, "path": "res://assets/characters/npc_identity/lanekit_f38_17_solene/solene_floor1_lod0.glb"}, "portrait": "res://assets/ui/portraits/officer_b.png"},
    "lanekit_f38_17_hald": {"enabled": true, "_why_on": "LANE-KIT 7 Nov 2026, qj F38-17-f8ab7f3fcf77-11072319: F38#17 CPU mapped 5.81 -> 7.32 (+1.51; raw 5.5 5.6 5.2 -> 6.6 6.6 6.3, all three judges: Solene and Hald now distinct and matching their portraits; defect PARTIAL -> FIXED). Judged gain ships ON.", "_why": "F38#17 (LANE-KIT, 7 Nov 2026; CPU 6.70, GPU 5.84): judges 'Warder Solene and Keeper Hald share one pink-uniform grunt model, and both portraits show a dark masked figure that does not match it'. Installed cast only (no Meshy): the installed captain_b rig and mesh, copied byte-for-byte with its installed graded vis1 atlas embedded (ralph/reports/LANES/ITEM-F38-17/embed_atlas_glb.py), and its installed matching plate captain_b.png. Rank palette, badges, height and clips stay the rank's. Team Tether's own colours. OFF until judged.", "expected_base_profile": "grunt", "expected_model": "res://assets/characters/grunt/grunt_lod0.glb", "body_model_override": "res://assets/characters/npc_identity/lanekit_f38_17_hald/hald_lod0.glb", "body_model_floor_1113": {"_why": "F38#17 (LANE-THINGS, 13 Nov 2026, OFF until judged). GPU 3/3 across three batches: Warder Solene's face is blown out white in the stronghold courtyard. CPU: the plain grunt in her place washes out too, so it is the courtyard light on pale texels; the conversation key light and her self-emission each change little. The Captain Marrow recipe (below6_marrow_self_lit_off, +1.40 on the GPU), for these two bodies only: a second copy of the variant's model whose embedded atlas has texels above 0.38 luma pulled half-way down (hue kept). Pair with character_body_flags.json things_self_lit_off_1112. Provenance: provenance_floor1.json beside the model.", "scope": "client_presentation", "enabled": false, "path": "res://assets/characters/npc_identity/lanekit_f38_17_hald/hald_floor1_lod0.glb"}, "portrait": "res://assets/ui/portraits/captain_b.png"},
    "meshy_f41_8_bryn_teal": {"enabled": true, "_why": "F41#8 (LANE-MESHY, 11 Nov 2026), rides with distinct_bodies_1111 (OFF): judge c (G-meshy-f41-8-distinct-bodies) said that at small size Hesk (alpha_tracker) and Bryn (lost_traveler) share a tan-and-brown palette. Only lost_traveler's olive scarf and trousers are recoloured to a muted teal-green (hue 165) by ralph/reports/LANES/MESHY-F41-8-BODIES/recolor_bryn.py. Hair, skin, boots, bedroll and face keep their pixels. The portrait is a Blender render of the same recoloured body. No red or oxblood. Applied only when distinct_bodies_1111 names this variant.", "expected_base_profile": "lost_traveler", "expected_model": "res://assets/characters/lost_traveler/lost_traveler_lod0.glb", "body_albedo_override": "res://assets/characters/lost_traveler/meshy_f41_8_bryn_albedo.png", "portrait": "res://assets/ui/portraits/meshy_f41_8_bryn.png", "review_status": "off_pending_gpu_judge", "authoring_provenance": {"producer": "res://ralph/reports/LANES/MESHY-F41-8-BODIES/recolor_bryn.py", "source_texture": "res://assets/characters/lost_traveler/lost_traveler_lod0_texture_0_vis1.png", "source_texture_sha256": "1774c17da4310cc23f6929e2f93d097ee14fa5efef85114aea0e940e5063b19a", "target_hue_degrees": 165, "portrait": "Blender Cycles render of lost_traveler_lod0.glb with the recoloured albedo"}},
    "lanekit_f41_8_bryn": {"enabled": true, "_why_on": "LANE-KIT 7 Nov 2026, qj F41-8-12e5730a78f0-11072254: F41#8 CPU mapped 5.47 -> 5.83 (+0.36); judged gain ships ON (blue-grey hue 212 coat)", "_why": "F41#8 named silhouettes (LANE-KIT, 7 Nov 2026; GPU 4.03/CPU 4.96): Stormwood's three local_historian roles share one body and coat. Same installed mesh, rig, face and hair; only the olive coat cloth recoloured (hue 212 deg) by ralph/reports/LANES/ITEM-F41-8/recolor_coat.py from the live vis1 albedo, with a matching portrait recoloured from the installed old_perrin plate by the same script (the --author-appearance mode is gated to the Tidewake ids). No red or oxblood. OFF until judged.", "expected_base_profile": "local_historian", "expected_model": "res://assets/characters/local_historian/local_historian_lod0.glb", "body_albedo_override": "res://assets/characters/local_historian/lanekit_f41_8_bryn_albedo.png", "portrait": "res://assets/ui/portraits/lanekit_f41_8_bryn.png", "review_status": "off_pending_cpu_quick_judge", "authoring_provenance": {"producer": "res://ralph/reports/LANES/ITEM-F41-8/recolor_coat.py", "source_texture": "res://assets/characters/local_historian/local_historian_lod0_texture_0_vis1.png", "source_texture_sha256": "b47b932316959671ca5d2cf251f70db033b247d1d43267c173a3ea7b58cd29c4", "target_hue_degrees": 212}},
    "lanekit_f41_8_maud": {"enabled": true, "_why_on": "LANE-KIT 7 Nov 2026, qj F41-8-12e5730a78f0-11072254: F41#8 CPU mapped 5.47 -> 5.83 (+0.36); judged gain ships ON (violet hue 265 coat)", "_why": "F41#8 named silhouettes (LANE-KIT, 7 Nov 2026; GPU 4.03/CPU 4.96): Stormwood's three local_historian roles share one body and coat. Same installed mesh, rig, face and hair; only the olive coat cloth recoloured (hue 265 deg) by ralph/reports/LANES/ITEM-F41-8/recolor_coat.py from the live vis1 albedo, with a matching portrait recoloured from the installed old_perrin plate by the same script (the --author-appearance mode is gated to the Tidewake ids). No red or oxblood. OFF until judged.", "expected_base_profile": "local_historian", "expected_model": "res://assets/characters/local_historian/local_historian_lod0.glb", "body_albedo_override": "res://assets/characters/local_historian/lanekit_f41_8_maud_albedo.png", "portrait": "res://assets/ui/portraits/lanekit_f41_8_maud.png", "review_status": "off_pending_cpu_quick_judge", "authoring_provenance": {"producer": "res://ralph/reports/LANES/ITEM-F41-8/recolor_coat.py", "source_texture": "res://assets/characters/local_historian/local_historian_lod0_texture_0_vis1.png", "source_texture_sha256": "b47b932316959671ca5d2cf251f70db033b247d1d43267c173a3ea7b58cd29c4", "target_hue_degrees": 265}},
