    "beings_stormwood_maren": {"enabled": false, "_why": "LANE-BEINGS (13 Nov 2026), BEINGS-OFFICER-FACES. G-below6-uniform-cloth-c673 and G-below6-staticub-fur-dialogue-c673 (3/3): Lieutenant Sera and Officer Maren share one face, coat and portrait (officer_b); Officer Nysa shows Lieutenant Varga's male face and portrait (officer_a). Installed cast only, identity-preserving hair-colour variant made by ralph/reports/LANES/BEINGS-OFFICER-FACES/derive_officer_hair.py; face, skin, coat and rig keep their pixels. OFF until GPU-judged. Maren keeps officer_b with chestnut-honey hair.", "expected_base_profile": "officer_b", "expected_model": "res://assets/characters/officer_b/officer_b_lod0.glb", "body_albedo_override": "res://assets/characters/officer_b/officer_b_lod0_texture_0_vis1_maren.png", "portrait": "res://assets/ui/portraits/npc_identity_stormwood_maren.png"},
    "beings_stormwood_nysa": {"enabled": false, "_why": "LANE-BEINGS (13 Nov 2026), BEINGS-OFFICER-FACES. G-below6-uniform-cloth-c673 and G-below6-staticub-fur-dialogue-c673 (3/3): Lieutenant Sera and Officer Maren share one face, coat and portrait (officer_b); Officer Nysa shows Lieutenant Varga's male face and portrait (officer_a). Installed cast only, identity-preserving hair-colour variant made by ralph/reports/LANES/BEINGS-OFFICER-FACES/derive_officer_hair.py; face, skin, coat and rig keep their pixels. OFF until GPU-judged. Nysa moves from officer_a (Varga's male face) to a copy of officer_b with ash-silver hair embedded in its atlas, so she is neither Varga nor a second Sera. The game's text never states Nysa's gender; the judges read her as a woman. HELD for the owner (coordinator, 13 Nov): it would give Nysa a woman's face, which the game has never stated; not attached to any trainer. To use it, point officer_nysa_deepwood_rod's appearance_variant_id at this record.", "expected_base_profile": "officer_a", "expected_model": "res://assets/characters/officer_a/officer_a_lod0.glb", "body_model_override": "res://assets/characters/npc_identity/stormwood_nysa/nysa_lod0.glb", "portrait": "res://assets/ui/portraits/npc_identity_stormwood_nysa.png"},
    "beings_stormwood_nysa_hair": {"enabled": false, "_why": "LANE-BEINGS (13 Nov 2026), BEINGS-OFFICER-FACES-NYSA-HAIR, the gender-neutral Nysa option (coordinator, 13 Nov: the game has never stated Nysa's gender, so changing her face is the owner's call). Nysa keeps her officer_a face and the judged uniform cloth; only her hair (ash-silver) and plate change, so she separates from Lieutenant Varga (G-below6-staticub-fur-dialogue-c673, 3/3: 'Officer Nysa shows the same male face and portrait as Lieutenant Varga'). Made by ralph/reports/LANES/BEINGS-OFFICER-FACES/derive_officer_hair.py --nysa-neutral from officer_a_lod0_texture_0_vis1_cloth2.png. OFF until GPU-judged.", "expected_base_profile": "officer_a", "expected_model": "res://assets/characters/officer_a/officer_a_lod0.glb", "body_albedo_override": "res://assets/characters/officer_a/officer_a_lod0_texture_0_vis1_cloth2_nysa.png", "portrait": "res://assets/ui/portraits/npc_identity_stormwood_nysa_hair.png"}
  },
  "_comment": "P2-055 paired presentation candidates; global and per-record gates remain OFF. Six installed-rig cloth variants are preserved. Adair has one identity-preserving model candidate with a dedicated portrait destination; incomplete pairs retain the installed body and portrait. Names, rank, height, gameplay and the shared base models are unchanged."
}
